# 数据消费纪律（与 abnk-asdm 仓相反）：src/data/ 下是 sync-data.sh 的只读复制产物
# 与契约校验样例，构建时生成、不入库——任何机器 checkout 两仓 + npm run sync 即可复现。
# 唯一例外：schema.ts 是入库的消费契约（已知坑 7：首个提交含契约），显式反选保留。
# Data discipline (opposite of the abnk-asdm repo): everything under src/data/
# is either a sync product or a contract sample, generated at build time and
# never committed — except schema.ts, the committed consumption contract.
src/data/*
!src/data/schema.ts

# 旅程素材直供通道（任务 3.5）：public/evidence/ 下是 sync-data.sh 的只读复制
# 产物与生成的资产清单 manifest.json，构建时生成、不入库（与 src/data/ 同纪律）。
# Journey direct-serve channel (task 3.5): everything under public/evidence/ is
# a sync-data.sh copy product plus the generated manifest.json — generated at
# build time and never committed (same discipline as src/data/).
public/evidence

.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.env
